---
title: Capicola sandwich
servings: 1
yield: 1 sandwich
tags: [italian, pork, quick]
cuisine: italian
source: Capicola Sandwich by StarChefs, https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/capicola-sandwich
---

Toss the @arugula{} with just enough @extra virgin olive oil{} to coat.

Split the @focaccia{}. Spread the @nduja{1%tbsp} on the top half.

On the bottom half, layer the @capicola{}(thinly sliced),
@salami{}(thinly sliced), @provolone{}(sliced), the dressed arugula and the
@artichoke hearts{}. Close and serve.
